      "text": "azd up\n\nBuilds the image in Azure Container Registry,\nstores your gh token as a secret,\nand sends logs to Log Analytics.",
      "originalText": "azd up\n\nBuilds the image in Azure Container Registry,\nstores your gh token as a secret,\nand sends logs to Log Analytics.",
